/* 战斗段落：地图 action 跳转到这里做全屏渲染，战毕回「探索」 */

:: 攻击哥布林
<<run (new setup.RPG.BattleTurn(setup.DND3.Player, setup.DND3.Goblin)).execute()>>
<<if not setup.DND3.Goblin.isDown>>
<<run (new setup.RPG.BattleTurn(setup.DND3.Goblin, setup.DND3.Player)).execute()>>
<<else>>
<<run setup.RPG.loot(setup.DND3.Goblin)>>
<</if>>

[[继续攻击|攻击哥布林]]
[[停手离开|探索]]

:: 首领战
储物间深处的阴影里站起来一个块头更大的哥布林——它敲着胸脯吼了一嗓子，
角落里那只受伤的哥布林也强撑着爬了起来。墙角传来一声呻吟：一个**受伤的守卫**
被绑在柱子上，看到你后挣扎着低声说："帮我……解开绳子，我还能打。"

<<link "解开守卫的绳子（2v2 交互战）">><<run setup.DND3.Guard.hp = Math.max(setup.DND3.Guard.hp, 6)>><<goto "守卫并肩战">><</link>>
<<if not setup.DND3.Goblin.isDown>>
[[独自挑战（1v2 自动战）|独自首领战]]
<<else>>
[[独自挑战首领|独自首领战]]
<</if>>

:: 守卫并肩战
<<set _allies to []>>
<<run _allies.push(setup.DND3.Player)>>
<<if not setup.DND3.Guard.isDown>>
<<run _allies.push(setup.DND3.Guard)>>
<</if>>
<<set _foes to []>>
<<if not setup.DND3.Goblin.isDown>>
<<run _foes.push(setup.DND3.Goblin)>>
<</if>>
<<if not setup.DND3.GoblinBoss.isDown>>
<<run _foes.push(setup.DND3.GoblinBoss)>>
<</if>>
<<if _foes.length gt 0>>
<<run (new setup.RPG.Battle(5, _allies, _foes, true)).execute()>>
<<else>>
哥布林们已经倒下了。
<</if>>
<<if setup.DND3.GoblinBoss.isDown>>
<<run setup.RPG.loot(setup.DND3.GoblinBoss)>>
<</if>>
<<if setup.DND3.Goblin.isDown>>
<<run setup.RPG.loot(setup.DND3.Goblin)>>
<</if>>

[[查看情况|探索]]

:: 独自首领战
<<if not setup.DND3.Goblin.isDown>>
<<run (new setup.RPG.Battle(5, [setup.DND3.Player], [setup.DND3.Goblin, setup.DND3.GoblinBoss])).execute()>>
<<else>>
<<run (new setup.RPG.Battle(5, [setup.DND3.Player], [setup.DND3.GoblinBoss])).execute()>>
<</if>>
<<if setup.DND3.GoblinBoss.isDown>>
<<run setup.RPG.loot(setup.DND3.GoblinBoss)>>
<</if>>

<<if not setup.DND3.GoblinBoss.isDown and not setup.DND3.Player.isDown>>
[[再战|独自首领战]]
<</if>>
[[查看情况|探索]]
